{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dream Runner",
    "steam_appid": 3035870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/0474f8540b9691a5fec1df7556e58710.avif?t=1749447567\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Runner is a heartwarming, 2D adventure platformer following Soma's story of self-reflection as he's forced to master newfound abilities in order to save his lost best friend.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/f5bc04f358adbc5c63feec86dc29b6ff.webp?t=1749447567\" width=275 height=21 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted pixel art world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth &quot;flow-state&quot; precision platforming focused on combo-ing abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of self-reflection as you venture deeper into the Dreamscape to rescue a lost friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, catch butterflies, and venture through hidden paths as you move through Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your platforming abilities to the test in a flurry of post-game challenge levels in Arcade Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/02c5223722b262e3c4d509d837555113.poster.avif?t=1749447567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/02c5223722b262e3c4d509d837555113.webm?t=1749447567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/6a1bd5229d411fcfe20184e506d3d404.avif?t=1749447567\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/0474f8540b9691a5fec1df7556e58710.avif?t=1749447567\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Runner is a heartwarming, 2D adventure platformer following Soma's story of self-reflection as he's forced to master newfound abilities in order to save his lost best friend.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/f5bc04f358adbc5c63feec86dc29b6ff.webp?t=1749447567\" width=275 height=21 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted pixel art world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth &quot;flow-state&quot; precision platforming focused on combo-ing abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of self-reflection as you venture deeper into the Dreamscape to rescue a lost friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, catch butterflies, and venture through hidden paths as you move through Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your platforming abilities to the test in a flurry of post-game challenge levels in Arcade Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/02c5223722b262e3c4d509d837555113.poster.avif?t=1749447567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/02c5223722b262e3c4d509d837555113.webm?t=1749447567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/6a1bd5229d411fcfe20184e506d3d404.avif?t=1749447567\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "On the eve of their Dream Trials, Soma and Nigel are ripped from one another by an unexpected disaster. Now, Soma has to learn to overcome his toughest challenges on his own. Master new abilities, overcome platforming challenges, and solve puzzles as you work to reunite with your lost best friend!",
